    "detailed_description": "STORY:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEndless Runner 3d game where player controls cyborg. Mission is to survive as long as can and collect skulls. More time player survives more steam achievements he collects. There is several enemies which kills player and then need restart level. Moving enemies, spike enemies and also red balls kills player. Player can collect blue cubes which gives shield for limited time and then player can destroy enemies<br />\r\nCan you be the real endless runner master and collect 300 skulls to beat the game<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n- Steam achievements<br />\r\n- Collectable skulls. <br />\r\n- Spikes and moving enemies which kill player.<br />\r\n- Red balls which kill player<br />\r\n- Shields which gives player ability to destroy enemies at limited time<br />\r\n- Slow motion feature",
